  "display_title": "Marry In Bed at 19",
  "description": "\"I'm going to give you a birthday present, a boyfriend of your own.\" \n\nMea Hyun and star actor Sung Si-Eun are seemingly perfect BFFs. Everyone calls Hyun \"Sung Si-Eun's maid,\" because she's always cleaning up after Si-Eun's antics. But Hyun cherishes their friendship and will do anything to protect it. Because she's the daughter of an alcoholic, had no talent of her own, and nobody else liked her. On Hyun's birthday, Si-Eun drops a bombshell by offering her a boyfriend as a present. What's worse, it's Nam Te-Ri, a boy who's always disliked her… \n\nWhat are they thinking? They must be out of their minds! \n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
